---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---
<Layout title="Contact | ZTEIST" lang="en">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
    <h1 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold text-zte-navy">Contact Us</h1>
    <p class="mb-4">ZTEIST is a non-profit, volunteer-run community for everyone who has been part of ZTE. Whether you'd like to —</p>
    <ul class="mb-6 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
      <li>Join and reconnect with old colleagues</li>
      <li>Match supply/demand, jobs, or projects</li>
      <li>Take your enterprise overseas, with localization or subcontracting support</li>
      <li>Source from China, or run background checks on suppliers</li>
      <li>Share feedback or ask questions</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mb-2">we'd love to hear from you:</p>
    <p class="mb-8">
      <span class="font-medium">Email: </span>
      <a href="mailto:support@zteist.com" class="text-zte-blue underline">support@zteist.com</a>
      <span class="mx-2 text-gray-400">/</span>
      <a href="mailto:7525707@qq.com" class="text-zte-blue underline">7525707@qq.com</a>
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">We'll get back to you as soon as we can.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
